					"label": "Body (HTML)",
					"esc": "raw",
					"default": "Umoya is African-led and African-owned, and of the diaspora ourselves. <strong>Wilson Nyah</strong> built it over a decade of work across the continent, and on the relationships that came with it. Those relationships are why <strong>Lucia Motloung</strong> pours her own wine on your first evening, and why <strong>Antoinette Sithole</strong> sits at your table in Soweto and tells you about the day in 1976 she lived herself."
				}
			],
			"rows": [
				{
					"body_markup": "Umoya is African-led and African-owned, and of the diaspora ourselves. <strong>Wilson Nyah</strong> built it over a decade of work across the continent, and on the relationships that came with it. Those relationships are why <strong>Lucia Motloung</strong> pours her own wine on your first evening, and why <strong>Antoinette Sithole</strong> sits at your table in Soweto and tells you about the day in 1976 she lived herself."
				},
				{
					"body_markup": "Around those moments, the work is ours. You are met at the airport, a host stays with you the whole way, and what would normally be yours to organise is carried for you. You arrive as a guest of people who are glad to share their home."
				}
			],
			"loops": 1,
			"selector": ".fc-why-body",
